* vendor_diode.lib - fictitious "vendor-style" diode model file
* Loosely modeled after a 1N4148-like small-signal switching diode,
* written as a .subckt wrapper (as many vendor model files do) so that
* we exercise .subckt + .model loading via .lib/.include, not just a bare .model.
* THIS IS A DISPOSABLE TEST FIXTURE - not a verified vendor part.

.subckt VENDOR_D1N4148_TEST A K
D1 A K DVENDOR
.model DVENDOR D(IS=4.352e-9 N=1.906 BV=100 IBV=1e-4 RS=0.6647
+ CJO=7.048e-13 VJ=0.869 M=0.03 TT=3.48e-9)
.ends VENDOR_D1N4148_TEST
